      <p><seg source="#source-478-507">夜はくだつ十一時、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-507-522">霜さむく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-522-534"><rb>圧</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-534-543">しくる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-543-558"><rb>闇</rb><rt>やみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-558-567">の気の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-567-582"><rb>凍</rb><rt>いて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582-590">に、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-590-602"><rb>舞</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-602-605">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-605-620"><rb>疲</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-620-629">れては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-629-653"><rb>黄塵</rb><rt>わうじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-653-658">も</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-658-679">しくしくと泣き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-679-694"><rb>湿</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-694-702">り、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-702-723"><rb>侘寝</rb><rt>わびね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-723-739">すらし。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-739-754"><rb>色</rb><rt>いろ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754-766"><rb>褪</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-766-772">めし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-772-802"><rb>達摩像</rb><rt>だるまぞう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-802-807">、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-807-822">はた古りし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-822-843"><rb>徳利</rb><rt>とくり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-843-878">のやうに、つくねんと、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-878-902"><rb>屑本</rb><rt>くずほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-902-917">のちりばふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-917-932"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-932-937">に</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-937-952"><rb>頸</rb><rt>くび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-952-961">ほそう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-961-979"><rb>客</rb><rt>きやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-979-982">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-982-994"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-994-999">つ</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-999-1017"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1017-1020">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1020-1038"><rb>女</rb><rt>をみな</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1042-1057"><rb>煤</rb><rt>すゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1057-1066">けたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1066-1093"><rb>帆木綿</rb><rt>ほもめん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1093-1098">に</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1098-1122"><rb>一品</rb><rt>いつぴん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1122-1125">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125-1143"><rb>文字</rb><rt>もじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1143-1146">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1146-1161"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1161-1170">しく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1170-1182"><rb>灯</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1182-1185">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1185-1200"><rb>曇</rb><rt>くも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1200-1208">り、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1208-1238"><rb>皿道具</rb><rt>さらだうぐ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1238-1250"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1250-1253">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1253-1268"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1268-1285">へ、つと、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1285-1300"><rb>忍</rb><rt>しの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1300-1326">びよる黒き物――</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1326-1350"><rb>巡査</rb><rt>じゆんさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1350-1366">なりき。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1366-1378"><rb>火</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1378-1381">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1381-1396"><rb>番</rb><rt>ばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1396-1399">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1399-1426"><rb>拍子木</rb><rt>へうしぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1426-1431">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1431-1452"><rb>後方</rb><rt>しりへ</rt></ruby>より『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1461-1485"><rb>鍋焼</rb><rt>なべやき</rt></ruby>うどん』、また<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1506-1518"><rb>来</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1518-1529">るは、</seg></p>
      <p>よきこゑの『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1547-1562"><rb>恋</rb><rt>こひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1562-1565">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1565-1589"><rb>辻占</rb><rt>つじうら</rt></ruby>』</p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1594-1612"><rb>鮭</rb><rt>しやけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1612-1621">さげて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1621-1642"><rb>小走</rb><rt>こばし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1642-1650">りの</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1650-1665"><rb>町</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1665-1668">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1668-1692"><rb>若衆</rb><rt>わかしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1692-1699">。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1699-1726"><rb>炭俵</rb><rt>すみだわら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1726-1735">、はた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1735-1750"><rb>薪</rb><rt>まき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1750-1758">か、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1758-1776"><rb>河岸</rb><rt>かし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1776-1791"><rb>遠</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791-1809">く、をりから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1809-1824"><rb>物</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1824-1827">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1827-1839"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1839-1845">つる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1845-1860"><rb>音</rb><rt>おと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1860-1865">、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1865-1871">犬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1871-1886"><rb>声</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1886-1898">、さはれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1898-1925"><rb>五分時</rb><rt>ごふんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1925-1930">、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1930-1954"><rb>濁水</rb><rt>だくすい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1954-1957">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1957-1972"><rb>音</rb><rt>おと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1972-1983">もなく</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1983-1998">西へ流る。</seg></p>
    </body>
